  "title": "Roquefort Pear Salad",
  "description": "This festive pear salad is a delicious combination of lettuce topped with tangy blue cheese, sweet pears, candied pecans, and a mustard vinaigrette.",
  "authors": [
    "Michelle Krzmarzick"
