  "ingredients": [
    "0.5 cup pecans",
    "0.25 cup white sugar",
    "0.33333334326744 cup olive oil",
    "3 tablespoons red wine vinegar",
    "1.5 teaspoons white sugar",
    "1.5 teaspoons prepared mustard",
    "1 clove garlic, chopped",
    "0.5 teaspoon salt",
    "fresh ground black pepper to taste",
    "1 head green leaf lettuce, torn into bite-sized pieces",
    "3 medium pears - peeled, cored and chopped",
    "5 ounces Roquefort cheese, crumbled",
    "1 medium avocado - peeled, pitted, and diced",
    "0.5 cup thinly sliced green onions"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/dZ_2N0uu_BgfrhJtmPI0Ju3Grh0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/34613-roquefort-pear-salad-DDMFS-step-1-BG-4553-381f6106556e46ffbabf967dda8aed46.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/34613/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the candied pecans: Combine pecans and sugar in a skillet over medium heat. Cook, stirring gently, until sugar has melted and pecans are caramelized, 5 to 7 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/9c4Hcd3PqIDqVldljkFctI1tNWk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/34613-roquefort-pear-salad-DDMFS-step-2-BG-4572-da73916e781644768eb9eb8e1c86fab8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/34613/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Carefully transfer nuts onto a sheet of waxed paper to cool.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/M2Kaz0n9nD6qTSAgD_1LDs_NJho=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/34613-roquefort-pear-salad-DDMFS-step-3-BG-4577-6e0cf88d268d4f38a8f31d90a8dc3836.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/34613/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the nuts are cooling, make the dressing: Whisk oil, vinegar, sugar, mustard, garlic, salt, and pepper together in a bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/i3arzLR89ApxTAXqgXSXcJ2H2Jk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/34613-roquefort-pear-salad-DDMFS-step-4-BG-4587-632af28e07954e369f1323c0aa8c6a95.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/34613/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the salad: Layer lettuce, pears, Roquefort cheese, avocado, and green onions in a large serving bowl. Pour dressing over top.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/t7S58fPCD33nSFyChoZFnE0SmkE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/34613-roquefort-pear-salad-DDMFS-step-5-BG-4595-980aa00975e544d19276a2e4fe326ac1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/34613/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Break cooled pecans into pieces and sprinkle over salad.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
